#: lesson.yml:title
msgid "Trans-Cis isomerization in the ground and excited states using PLUMED"
msgstr "PLUMED を用いた Ground State と Excited State における Trans-Cis Isomerization"

#: lesson.yml:description
msgid ""
"A guide to perform ground and excited state simulations using PLUMED to "
"simulate a trans to cis isomerization process."
msgstr ""
"PLUMED で Trans-Cis Isomerization をシミュレーションするために、Ground State と Excited State"
" のシミュレーションを行う手順を説明するガイド。"
